            <ArticleTitle>Meeting the clinical challenges of burns management: a review.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>S44, S46-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This article will look at some of the major clinical challenges faced by the clinician when managing the burn wound, identify how the Mölnlycke Health Care range of dressings with Safetac® is designed to meet these needs and provide evidence of the effectiveness of these products in this challenging field of wound care.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
